// Test fixture: what an Ambient conversation may and may not do.
// Compile with: ysc compile ambient.yarn -o . -n ambient

title: GoodBanter
kind: Ambient
participants: A, B
---
A: Cold tonight. #line:good_banter_cold
B: Colder tomorrow. #line:good_banter_colder
===

title: BanterWithChoice
kind: Ambient
participants: A, B
---
A: Well? #line:banter_choice_well
-> Answer. #line:banter_choice_answer
===

title: BanterStranger
kind: Ambient
participants: A, B
---
A: Who's that? #line:banter_stranger_who
C: Nobody. #line:banter_stranger_nobody
===

title: BanterTrade
kind: Ambient
participants: A, B
---
A: Let's trade. #line:banter_trade_lets
<<OpenTrade>>
===

title: BanterNoParticipants
kind: Ambient
---
A: Hello? #line:banter_nobody_hello
===

title: BanterAttach
kind: Ambient
participants: A, B
attach: Speaker.Role == guard
---
A: Hm. #line:banter_attach_hm
===
